  "verse": "You have heard from the proclaimers, the prophets, that you shall select a wise head (wise leader) for your guidance and instruction so that you may live in love and peace as well as in freedom and balance (harmony)… and you shall not take up arms and fight against one another or against other tribes and peoples; if you are however attacked by a battle troop (war troop/military) with armed Gewalt… then fight against it with gewaltsame Gewaltlosigkeit… however, you shall not let yourselves be stirred up (be agitated) to battles with weapons, neither in the family nor amongst groups, nor by following authority or leaders and rulers and not by following priests and other worshipers of gods and tin gods.",
